 "title": "Adventure on Bamboo 29er's",
 "body_html": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">Limitless Adventure is traveling around the world here is some more info about their ethos. You can learn more at <a href=\"https://limitless.eco/adventure/\">https://limitless.eco/adventure/</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>Get There Without Fossil Fuels</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you can swing it, get into nature using an emissions-free method. If you can\u2019t, we totally understand. Reduce your impact by ride-sharing, or choosing a place as close to you as possible. If you need to travel far away, balance your impact through earth-healing volunteerism or donations to earth-healing organizations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>Leave Nature Better Than When You Found It</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pick up other people\u2019s trash. Don\u2019t leave trash behind. Bury your poop. Put out your campfire. Don\u2019t touch animals (seriously, it can be life-ending for them). Plant something in a desertified place. Forage in a way that doesn\u2019t decimate the plant population. Basically \u2026 the earth is alive, treat her like you\u2019d treat a friend</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>Bring an Indoor Friend With You</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your indoor friend needs time in nature just as much as we all do. Choose an indoor friend, and invite them kindly, but relentlessly to join you. Also, be gentle when reintroducing your indoor friend to our earth. Start out with easy trips on beautiful days, and then work your way up to crossing the Pyrenees on bamboo bikes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:image {\"id\":15675,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502